id|name|family|equipment|setup|action|cue|mistake
dumbbell_bench_press|Dumbbell Bench Press|press|dumbbells,flat_bench|Lie on a flat bench with a dumbbell above each side of the chest and feet supported.|Lower the weights beside the chest, then press them above the shoulders.|Keep wrists above elbows.|Colliding the dumbbells at the top.
