close_grip_bench_press|Close-Grip Bench Press|press|flat_bench,olympic_barbell,plates,squat_rack|Set up in a rack with safeties and use a grip around shoulder width rather than hands touching.|Lower the bar with elbows near the torso, then press back above the shoulders.|Keep forearms near vertical at the bottom.|Forcing an excessively narrow wrist position.
