dumbbell_squeeze_press|Dumbbell Squeeze Press|press|dumbbells,flat_bench|Lie on a bench holding two suitable flat-sided dumbbells together above the chest.|Keep gentle inward pressure as you lower to the chest and press upward.|Use controllable weights that stay together.|Letting a dumbbell roll or slip toward the face.
